<title>AUSTRIA: Wolford sets up Japanese sales unit.</title>
<headline>Wolford sets up Japanese sales unit.</headline>
<dateline>VIENNA 1997-06-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Austrian luxury stocking manufacturer Wolford AG has founded its own sales and marketing subsidiary in Japan, the firm said on Friday.</p>
<p>Tokyo-based Wolford Japan K.K. will take over from the group's former distributor Bluebell Japan, Wolford said in a statement.</p>
<p>It also announced medium-term plans to open 30 outlets in Japanese department stores.</p>
<p>-- Vienna newsroom, +43-1 531 12 254</p>
